title: Override AI Ending
story: no-signal-home
description: Override AI ending via cable cut in maintenance shaft, then bridge override panel

---

## Start — collect essentials

> look
[OK: contains "Tug Cockpit"]

> take flashlight
[OK: contains_any "Taken" "already"]

> take ration bar
[OK: contains_any "Taken" "already"]

## Enter The Stillwater

> south
[OK: contains "Airlock"]

> south
[OK: contains "Forward Corridor"]

## Get cable snips and multi-tool from Engineering

> west
[OK: contains "Lower Mid Corridor"]

> south
[OK: contains "Aft Corridor"]

> south
[OK: contains "Engineering"]

> take cable snips
[OK: contains "Taken"]

> take multi-tool
[OK: contains "Taken"]

## Back to Maintenance Shaft and cut AI cables

> north
[OK: contains "Aft Corridor"]

> north
[OK: contains "Lower Mid Corridor"]

> east
[OK: contains "Forward Corridor"]

> east
[OK: contains "Maintenance Shaft"]

> cut cables
[OK: contains_any "cut" "sever" "spark" "dead" "dark" "slice"]

## Get keycard from Captain's Cabin

> west
[OK: contains "Forward Corridor"]

> west
[OK: contains "Lower Mid Corridor"]

> up
[OK: contains "Central Junction"]

> up
[OK: contains "Upper Corridor"]

> east
[OK: contains "Captain's Cabin"]

> pry open desk
[OK: contains_any "keycard" "bridge"]

> take keycard
[OK: contains_any "Taken" "keycard"]

## Unlock bridge and trigger Override ending

> west
[OK: contains "Upper Corridor"]

> unlock bridge door with keycard
[OK: contains_any "unlock" "green"]

> open bridge door
[OK: contains_any "open" "bridge"]

> north
[OK: contains "Bridge"]

> override security panel
[OK: contains "THE END"]
[OK: contains "Override"]
